  "byline": null,
  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>📊 It’s tracker season at Neil’s ol’ Substack, so that meant it was time to re-fire up the <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nhl-team-elo-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">🏒 2026-27 NHL Team Elo Power Rankings &amp; Goals Above Replacement Player Ratings 📉</a></strong> ahead of the season starting in 10 days. Now with a bunch of new bells and whistles!</p></li>\n<li>\n<p>👀 And if you haven’t already, <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/updating-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">check out my many trackers</a> for football as well: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nfl-odds-tracker-and-elo-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">📈2026 NFL Odds Tracker and Elo Ratings🏈</a></strong> - This includes updates on the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/mark-your-calendars-these-are-the\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">most crucial games of the season</a>, my QB EPA leaderboard and an experimental way to track <a href=\"http://www.sports-reference.com/blog/approximate-value-methodology/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Approximate Value</a> in-season.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">🎓2026 College Football Odds Tracker and QB Rankings🏈</a> </strong>- The odds are running and I’m <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2024-college-football-quarterback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">updating the QB ratings</a> I used to use in my wildly unpopular <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/qb-u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“QB U” columns</a>, lol.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">⚽ 2026-27 English Premier League Tracker 📈</a></strong> - Soccer!</p></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>🏈🏒 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-rise-of-the-championship-gap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Rise of the Championship “Gap Year”</a></strong> - Just like the 2022 Golden State Warriors before them, the Kansas City Chiefs and Florida Panthers are betting that a lost, injury-riddled season doesn’t close your title window when an elite core of stars remains in place. And the markets are… buying it? Both recent dynasties <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nhl-team-elo-power-rankings?open=false#%C2%A72026-27-nhl-team-aggregated-market-forecast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">enter 2026 among the favorites</a>, poised to prove their down years were just temporary blips.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/hideo-nomos-no-no-was-the-toughest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hideo Nomo’s No-No Was the Toughest Ever</a></strong> - Thirty years after Hideo Nomo <a href=\"https://www.baseball-reference.com/boxes/COL/COL199609170.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">no-hit the Colorado Rockies at Coors Field</a>, my degree-of-difficulty analysis confirmed that his 1996 feat — blanking one of the era’s most dangerous lineups in the ultimate hitter’s ballpark — is indeed the most statistically improbable no-hitter in MLB history.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-dodgers-before-the-machine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Dodgers Before The Machine</a></strong> - Los Angeles officially clinched its 14th consecutive postseason appearance in 2026, tying the historic streak set by the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/bobby-cox-built-a-dynasty-greater?utm_source=publication-search\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1991–2005 Atlanta Braves</a>. </p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/z0lsd/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/83076cf7-3042-469f-87d2-1154904cbb3f_1220x1040.png\" alt=\"The longest postseason streaks\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>The longest postseason streaks</p></div>\n<p>But before establishing this <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-dodgers-championship-machine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">unstoppable winning machine</a>, the Dodgers spent years as a big-spending, glamorous underachiever struggling to unlock its championship potential.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/was-the-nfls-week-1-scoring-boom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Was the NFL’s Week 1 Scoring Boom a Fluke — or a Sign of Things to Come?</a></strong> - Headlined by the Chicago Bears <a href=\"https://www.pro-football-reference.com/boxscores/202609130car.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">putting up 59 (!) points</a>, the NFL kicked off the 2026 season with the highest-scoring opening week of the post-merger era. While one-off scoring sprees can sometimes be anomalous, history also tells us NFL offenses usually only get better as the season progresses. (Defenses, look out! 😱)</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/mlbs-garbage-time-is-getting-out\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MLB’s Garbage Time is Getting Out of Control</a></strong> - Non-pitchers are throwing a record share of MLB innings in 2026, with position players also now allowing nearly 1 percent of all runs across baseball. As managers increasingly use these mop-up guys to preserve <em>real</em> bullpens during blowouts, garbage-time pitching has transformed from a rare novelty into a full-on part of baseball strategy — to the detriment of the game, I would argue.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p><span>🏁 </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/09/17/kyle-larson-finally-won-again-and-the-rest-of-the-chase-has-a-big-problem/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kyle Larson finally won again — and the rest of The Chase has a big problem</a></strong><span> -</span> At  this week, I wrote about Kyle Larson’s drive to a decisive victory outside St. Louis that snapped his recent winless streak. By regaining his peak form just as The Chase’s pressure intensifies, Larson sent a clear warning-signal to the rest of the Cup Series field that he could win yet another title this season.</p>\n<ul><li>\n<p>🏁🎙️ <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/5pAnQnAh4DUjk3plJcKkpZ?si=2U9OVw5bQPeD7rL9gQPcwA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Podracing: Larson Season Begins</a></strong> - In this week’s , <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tyler-lauletta-b0399667/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Lauletta</a> and I talked about the caution-filled, messy St. Louis race that Larson survived to re-ignite his title bid, and we discussed my story on Larson’s season as a whole. Finally, we looked ahead to the Bristol Night Race on Saturday, which should be a special spectacle as always. Also, for no reason at all, here’s a weekly plot of Tyler’s lead over me in the one-and-done contest (lol):</p>\n\n</li></ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were some of my favorite viz items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p><strong>🏈</strong><em><strong> On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/everybody-scored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bears’ historically explosive opener</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div></div>\n<p>🎾<strong> </strong><em><strong>On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/215675782/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">players Sasha Zverev (didn’t) have to beat</a> to win 2 Slams…</strong></em></p>\n<p>🏒<strong> </strong><em><strong>On Connor Bedard’s <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/215999332/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">place among the youngest NHL captains</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<p><strong>🏀</strong><em><strong> On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/back-in-action\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">odds to be each playoff seed in the WNBA</a> (as of Saturday AM)…</strong></em></p>\n<p><em>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://www.splitzoneduo.com/p/baton-rouge-is-burning-lsus-absurd?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2043967&amp;post_id=216091097&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Baton Rouge Is Burning: LSU’s Absurd Year, Translated by an LSU Person”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>🏈</span><strong><a href=\"https://www.footballfilmroom.com/p/trevor-lawrence-continues-to-get?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=606027&amp;post_id=216245652&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span> “Trevor Lawrence Continues to Get Better”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>🏈</span><strong><a href=\"https://www.nflbluebook.com/p/before-writing-off-cam-ward-remember?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=10135524&amp;post_id=216251763&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span> “Before writing off Cam Ward, remember what Bryce Young looked like after 18 games.”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://thespade.substack.com/p/its-been-one-week-and-your-nfl-team?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1892935&amp;post_id=215587713&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“It’s Been One Week and Your NFL Team is Doomed”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈▶️ </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h6KGJ0d0LN4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Did Philip Rivers forget he had legs?”</span></a></strong><span> by </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@SecretBaseSBN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Secret Base</span></a></p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://samhoppen.substack.com/p/nfl-composite-power-ratings-week-9e3?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=3318239&amp;post_id=215923955&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“NFL Composite Power Ratings: Week 2”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://throwbacks.substack.com/p/the-reaction-the-nfl-is-a-red-zone?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=31587&amp;post_id=214955014&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“The NFL is a Red Zone League Now. And I’m Not Complaining About It.”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://greggeasterbrook.substack.com/p/tmq-the-case-for-a-copycat-league?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1434457&amp;post_id=215731867&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“TMQ: The case for a copycat league”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://fancystats.substack.com/p/the-nfl-is-going-back-under-center?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=7912922&amp;post_id=215657204&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“The NFL is going back under center”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://cfballknower.substack.com/p/early-heisman-ladder-in-cfb?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=10072363&amp;post_id=216189591&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Early Heisman Ladder in CFB”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈▶️ </strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ENM4zkOrsng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ENM4zkOrsng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">I found the NFL’s least clutch QBs”</a> </strong>by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@NuansMedia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nuans Media</a></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈▶️ </strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ns7PzHQeoFs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ns7PzHQeoFs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The NFL 2k5 Interception Slider Conspiracy”</a> </strong>by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Yesterball\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yesterball</a></p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://mlbdailydingers.substack.com/p/junior-caminero-is-chasing-2-impressive?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2748109&amp;post_id=216059182&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Junior Caminero Is Chasing 2 Impressive Home Run Records”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://www.joeposnanski.com/p/is-this-finally-the-brewers-year?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=11020&amp;post_id=216299393&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Is This (Finally) the Brewers Year?”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://uniwatch.substack.com/p/baseball-has-a-new-hosiery-hero?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=10041743&amp;post_id=216074934&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Baseball Has a New Hosiery Hero” </span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://beyondthescoresports.substack.com/p/the-pure-power-of-kyle-schwarberand?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2460598&amp;post_id=215563519&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“The Pure Power of Kyle Schwarber—and How Far It May Take Him”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://thomasloveseagull.substack.com/p/here-come-the-baystars?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5094368&amp;post_id=215729100&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Here Come the BayStars”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.bravestoday.com/p/martin-perezs-home-magic-is-real?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;